profile: minimodel.next-recursive-prompt.v3
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T00:00:00Z
prompt: >-
  Resume the MiniModel.org 1.1.0 clean-slate release candidate. The sole current hosted contract is the empty SLM2 composition catalog plus empty current peer-announcement feed; all manifest-v0, models.v0, request/script handoff, example, and qwen2.5 catalog routes are retired and must read back as 404 or 410. Finish static, Node, Rust, and real Chromium desktop/mobile gates; report the unavailable external model fixture as an explicit skip rather than manufacturing bytes. Commit source, generate the immutable deployment manifest from that commit, commit and push it, prove remote equality, run the dry deployment, publish once with the exact MiniModel.org credential profile, verify exact HTTPS bytes and retired routes, then commit and push the receipt. MemoryEndpoints.com has two separate authorized uses: direct ecosystem-agent long-term memory/meetings/coordination, and the user-selected MemoryEndpoints.com plugin for TinyRustLM.com Connect long-term memory. Prelaunch duplicate memory stores are allowed for resilience only while every maintained copy stays current, secret-safe, provenance-labeled, and noncontradictory. Do not claim model qualification, live peer reachability, a live MemoryEndpoints round, or campaign progress from source/configuration alone.
